 x="40" y="520" width="360" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="CommandShell and CommandFactory get IFileSystemService and IConsoleService through their constructor. Commands use them through AbstractCommand." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="610" width="360" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="The parser cuts the command name at the first . or \ so that cd.. becomes cd and .. (CD-5)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="730" width="360" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="Service methods that CD-14 does not need throw NotImplementedException(&quot;CD-n&quot;). The story with that number implements the method." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="830" width="360" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="Later stories (not in Sprint 1): TypeCommand (CD-4), MoreCommand (CD-6), RenCommand (CD-7), MoveCommand (CD-11), DelCommand (CD-13)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="950" width="360" height="70" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="Use" style="endArrow=open;endSize=12;dashed=1;html=1;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;fontSize=11;exitX=0.5000